      "limitations_zh": [
        "只验证同一 procedure 的新输入，未验证新 procedure。",
        "Enterprise/Internal 未做反馈 repair，平台 completion 也可能把失败标作完成。",
        "SOP-Bench repair 可见训练标签，和 unrepaired 比较不是同等反馈；不能声称和 Agent 统计等价。"
      ],
      "primary_initial_suggestion": "borderline",
      "reason_zh": "更正初稿：真实执行反馈修复、迭代和同SOP新输入复用均成立；但产生的是替代原Agent完成特定业务SOP的独立任务程序，没有证据把该程序回装为原Agent自身可复用Harness组件，也没有修改生成器/改进器的共享Harness。符合当前外部任务产物边界；不能仅凭代码、反馈、复用三点纳入，也不以planner-free或无跨SOP迁移单独作为排除理由。",
      "resolution": "Initial independent inclusion and primary borderline were corrected after checking artifact role: per-SOP task program replaces the agent rather than updating its own reusable Harness. Feedback repair and cross-input reuse remain acknowledged.",
      "root_final_agrees": true,
      "secondary": [],
      "source_hash": "a5bc69ee116f13c5891914f0fe0227906a77eaad6dd663486062edd2b3c010a8",
